{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00930","headline":"横吹曲辞 出塞 · 张易之","name":"横吹曲辞 出塞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"侠客重恩光，骢马饰金装。\n瞥闻传羽檄，驰突救边荒。\n转战磨筓地，横行戴斗乡。\n将军占太白，小妇怨流黄。\n騕褭青丝骑，娉婷红粉妆。\n一春莺度曲，八月雁成行。\n谁堪坐秋思，罗袖拂空牀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张易之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00930.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00930","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}